  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add the onion and red bell pepper and cook for 5 to 6 minutes, stirring occasionally, until softened.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add the turkey mince and break it up with a spoon. Cook for 5 to 7 minutes until no pink remains and the mince starts to brown.",
    "Stir in the chilli powder, cumin, paprika and oregano, then add the tomato paste. Cook for 1 minute to toast the spices.",
    "Add the canned tomatoes, kidney beans, black beans and water. Season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Bring to a gentle simmer, then cook uncovered for 15 to 20 minutes, stirring occasionally, until thickened and rich. Taste and adjust the seasoning before serving."
